      "description": "ï»¿ Working at Quinnipiac University Site Alert Title Search is currently not available. Why Quinnipiac Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Medicine Law Online Apply Now Visit Make a Gift Contact Us Bookstores The Quinnipiac Experience Academics Student Experience Athletics & Recreation Explore Quinnipiac Quinnipiac Today Virtual Tour About Quinnipiac Alumni & Parents Alumni Parents Make a Gift Schools & Programs College of Arts & Sciences School of Business School of Communications School of Education School of Engineering School of Health Sciences School of Law School of Medicine School of Nursing Program Finder Dual-Degree Programs Visit Us Virtual Tour Open Houses Maps & Directions Tours & Info Sessions Information & Resources Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Bookstores Course Finder Diversity & Inclusion Events Calendar Faculty & Staff Directory Health & Campus Safety Student Consumer Information Tuition & Financial Aid University Policies For College Counselors For Community For Employers For Military For News Media Research & Organizations Institutes & Centers Ireland's Great Hunger Museum Quinnipiac University Online Quinnipiac University Poll Quinnipiac Magazine Helpful Links Log in to MyQ Make a Tuition Payment Manage a QCard Request a Transcript Work at Quinnipiac Schools Arts & Sciences Business Communications Education Engineering Health Sciences Law Medicine Nursing Looking for a specific program? Program Listing Dual-Degree Programs Working at Quinnipiac Carret icon Working at Quinnipiac Working at Quinnipiac Explore Job Opportunities Application Process Benefits Community Search and Apply for\n\t\t\t\t\t\tan Open Position Take the lead in shaping thousands of lives Quinnipiac University offers students the education and practice they need for a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsuccessful career â and itâs our driven, dedicated faculty, administrators and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tstaff who deliver on that promise. You wonât find a more supportive atmosphere\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tin which to make a difference or to advance your own career. Recognized as a âGreat College to Work Forâ as determined by a comprehensive\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tindustry survey, we place an emphasis on community, offer a host of competitive\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbenefits, strive to inspire and challenge, and foster a healthy workforce. To learn more about why WE ARE THE AMBITIOUS: Quinnipiac University Ambition Unleashed To become a part of our community, search the current job listings below: Faculty positions Administrative/staff positions Quinnipiac University has a strong commitment to the principles and practices\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tof diversity and inclusion throughout the university community. Quinnipiac University is an Equal Opportunity Employer. About Us An exciting place to learn, work and play We see things differently. We do things differently. And we give you the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\topportunity to impact our students and lead change in education.Â Our mission is to strive for excellence in education, to focus on the studentsâ\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tneeds and to foster a spirit of community in everything we do.Â Academic programs and services are offered in a highly personalized environment\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfeaturing small classes and ready access to faculty. We prepare graduates who\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdemonstrate critical and creative thinking, effective communication skills and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinformed value judgments, and who possess an educational foundation for\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcontinued growth and success in today's fast-moving society. We get to know our\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcolleagues and support our mutual goal of providing excellence in education. Learn more about Quinnipiac Photograph Quinnipiac Menâs Ice Hockey are National Champions Coach Rand Pecknold steps off the bench to cheer on the team with QU students and the community. Our Community People make the community Our mission emphasizes three core values: high-quality academic programs, a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tstudent-oriented environment and a sense of community. The people who work here\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbring the spirit of this mission to life. Get to know some of the amazing people\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twho make up our robust community. Meet our people Find a Career Join our team With more than 2,000 positions at Quinnipiac, thereâs a good\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tchance we have the perfect spot for you.Â Whether your passion is teaching in our College of Arts and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSciences or one of our 8 professional schools, engaging our\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tstudents in campus life activities, supporting university\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\toperations or ensuring our campuses and facilities are running\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsmoothly and looking great, we hope you will consider joining\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tour team. Positions are posted throughout the year, so please check back\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfrequently. Search positions and apply Photograph Employee Benefits Weâre committed to taking care of those who serve\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tour students and university well The health and well-being of our workforce is a top priority here\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand we strive to provide benefits that matter to our employees\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tat each stage of their employment. Benefits are an integral part\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tof an employeeâs total rewards package; from health care to\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tholidays, the Office of Human Resources is committed to\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsupporting our employeesâ happy and healthy lifestyles, while\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmaintaining a quality work-life balance. We offer a wide range of comprehensive and competitive benefits to ensure the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpersonal, financial, health and wellness needs of our employees and families are\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmet. We pay a significant portion of the cost for many benefit plans, offer a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tgenerous match in the retirement plan, and provide exceptional tuition benefits\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfor employees and their dependents. Our âLiving Wellâ wellness program engages\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand supports employees, and reflects our commitment to a healthy workforce. Our benefit programs extend to domestic partners of our benefit-eligible\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\temployees. Eligibility for benefits is dependent upon a variety of factors,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tincluding employment classification. Benefits Photograph Our Strategic Plan We are the University of the Future We are gutsy in our embrace of change; we are connected to the needs of the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfuture in our research and learning programs; we are preparing civically-engaged\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand 21st century-ready graduates who will advance society; we nurture the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twell-being of our community and its pursuit of lifelong learning; and we are\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thungry to be a force of good in the broader world we share. Quinnipiac is a place of constant beginnings and thanks to the committed\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tengagement of our entire community, the strategic planning process has resulted\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tin an exciting vision that builds the bridges to our shared future. To evolve into the University of the Future, this plan has four goals: Build an institution-wide mindset that prepares graduates for 21st-century\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcareers and citizenship Create an inclusive, excellence-driven community Nurture and positively impact internal, local and global communities Foster lifelong connections and success Read the strategic plan Contact Us If you have any questions or are seeking additional assistance Quinnipiac University Office of Human Resources 203-582-6486 humanresources@qu.edu Take the Next Step Join our community Explore and apply Learn more About Quinnipiac About Quinnipiac https://www.facebook.com/QuinnipiacUniversity http://twitter.com/quinnipiacu https://instagram.com/quinnipiacu © 2024 Quinnipiac University. All Rights Reserved. Website Security and Privacy Policy Legal Info"
