    "https://careers.qu.edu/application-process.html": {
      "title": "Application Process",
      "description": "ï»¿ Application Process | Working at Quinnipiac University Site Alert Title Search is currently not available. Why Quinnipiac Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Medicine Law Online Apply Now Visit Make a Gift Contact Us Bookstores The Quinnipiac Experience Academics Student Experience Athletics & Recreation Explore Quinnipiac Quinnipiac Today Virtual Tour About Quinnipiac Alumni & Parents Alumni Parents Make a Gift Schools & Programs College of Arts & Sciences School of Business School of Communications School of Education School of Engineering School of Health Sciences School of Law School of Medicine School of Nursing Program Finder Dual-Degree Programs Visit Us Virtual Tour Open Houses Maps & Directions Tours & Info Sessions Information & Resources Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Bookstores Course Finder Diversity & Inclusion Events Calendar Faculty & Staff Directory Health & Campus Safety Student Consumer Information Tuition & Financial Aid University Policies For College Counselors For Community For Employers For Military For News Media Research & Organizations Institutes & Centers Ireland's Great Hunger Museum Quinnipiac University Online Quinnipiac University Poll Quinnipiac Magazine Helpful Links Log in to MyQ Make a Tuition Payment Manage a QCard Request a Transcript Work at Quinnipiac Schools Arts & Sciences Business Communications Education Engineering Health Sciences Law Medicine Nursing Looking for a specific program? Program Listing Dual-Degree Programs Working at Quinnipiac Application Process Carret icon Application Process Working at Quinnipiac Explore Job Opportunities Application Process Benefits Community We make the application process as seamless as\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpossible. Our goal is to attract the most talented individuals to join our\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcommunity. Quinnipiac University fosters a culture where high performance is\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe standard, employee development is vital and the spirit of community is\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpresent in everything we do. Search Open Positions Find an open position As an Equal Opportunity Employer, we have a strong commitment to the principles\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand practices of diversity and inclusion, and we welcome candidates who will\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tenhance that diversity. Faculty positions Administrative/staff positions Steps to Apply Steps to apply 1. Visit the careers portal to view open positions. Search positions and apply 2. Apply online to the position that interests you. When applying,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tplease be sure to include all required application documents. We look forward to reviewing your application and thank you for\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinterest in joining the Quinnipiac Community. Frequently Asked Questions Frequently asked questions Q: Do I need an email address to apply for positions at\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tQuinnipiac? A: Yes. You will be notified by email to confirm your successful job\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tapplication. Q: Where can I find salary information for open positions? A: Salary information is not provided as part of the online job postings. The\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thiring department can provide this information during the selection process. Q: How long does a position remain open? A: Open positions at Quinnipiac do not have defined closing dates. All\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tapplications will be reviewed until a position is closed. Q: How do I check the status of my application? A: You can review your application status online in your applicant profile. Q: What happens after I submit my application for a position? A:Â You will receive an email confirming that your application has been\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsuccessfully submitted. Please be assured you will receive an email update regarding the status of your\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcandidacy for the position to which you applied. Take the Next Step Join our community Explore and apply Learn more About Quinnipiac About Quinnipiac https://www.facebook.com/QuinnipiacUniversity http://twitter.com/quinnipiacu https://instagram.com/quinnipiacu © 2024 Quinnipiac University. All Rights Reserved. Website Security and Privacy Policy Legal Info"
    },
    "https://careers.qu.edu/benefits.html": {
      "title": "Benefits",
      "description": "ï»¿ Benefits | Working at Quinnipiac University Site Alert Title Search is currently not available. Why Quinnipiac Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Medicine Law Online Apply Now Visit Make a Gift Contact Us Bookstores The Quinnipiac Experience Academics Student Experience Athletics & Recreation Explore Quinnipiac Quinnipiac Today Virtual Tour About Quinnipiac Alumni & Parents Alumni Parents Make a Gift Schools & Programs College of Arts & Sciences School of Business School of Communications School of Education School of Engineering School of Health Sciences School of Law School of Medicine School of Nursing Program Finder Dual-Degree Programs Visit Us Virtual Tour Open Houses Maps & Directions Tours & Info Sessions Information & Resources Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Bookstores Course Finder Diversity & Inclusion Events Calendar Faculty & Staff Directory Health & Campus Safety Student Consumer Information Tuition & Financial Aid University Policies For College Counselors For Community For Employers For Military For News Media Research & Organizations Institutes & Centers Ireland's Great Hunger Museum Quinnipiac University Online Quinnipiac University Poll Quinnipiac Magazine Helpful Links Log in to MyQ Make a Tuition Payment Manage a QCard Request a Transcript Work at Quinnipiac Schools Arts & Sciences Business Communications Education Engineering Health Sciences Law Medicine Nursing Looking for a specific program? Program Listing Dual-Degree Programs Working at Quinnipiac Benefits Carret icon Benefits Working at Quinnipiac Explore Job Opportunities Application Process Benefits Community Overview Our commitment to your well-being We are pleased to provide a strong package of total rewards and we are committed\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tto providing high-quality, affordable care to our employees and their families.Â At the core of every successful benefits program lies a culture of health and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twellness. Through our Living Well program, we hope to forge a partnership with\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tyou to help support your goals for healthy living. Our benefit programs span the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trange of physical, financial and behavioral health and wellness to work-life\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbalance and community service. We offer a variety of benefits to full- and part-time faculty, administrators and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclerical and facilities staff. Below is an overview of the types of benefits\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tavailable.Â Benefits Offered Our benefit programs include: Health care: including medical, dental, vision, Section 125 plan, payment in\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlieu of medical and dental benefits and health care flexible spending\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taccount (FSA) Income protection: including basic life insurance, basic accidental death\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand dismemberment coverage, supplemental voluntary life and AD&D\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinsurance, voluntary critical illness insurance, long-term disability\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinsurance (LTD) Education benefits: including tuition remission, tuition exchange program,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tConnecticut Higher Education Trust (CHET) 529 savings plan Future financial security: 403(b) defined contribution retirement plan,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttax-deferred annuity retirement savings plan, voluntary group long-term care\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinsurance Paid time off: vacation, sick days, paid holidays Work and family: dependent care flexible spending account, health advocate,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\temployee assistance program (EAP), Bobcat Rewards discount program, paid\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tparental leave for eligible faculty and staff, Living Well wellness program We offer flexible work arrangements for eligible staff based on school or \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdepartmental operational needs. Infertility benefits are offered and will be administered by Progyny and \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcovered in-network. There is no out-of-network coverage. Benefits coverage varies by employment type. Learn more about the benefit plans\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tby visiting the pages below. Full-time faculty and administrators Full-time clerical and facilities Full-time hourly staff Part-time faculty Take the Next Step Join our community Explore and apply Learn more About Quinnipiac About Quinnipiac https://www.facebook.com/QuinnipiacUniversity http://twitter.com/quinnipiacu https://instagram.com/quinnipiacu © 2024 Quinnipiac University. All Rights Reserved. Website Security and Privacy Policy Legal Info"
    },
    "https://careers.qu.edu/community.html": {
      "title": "Community",
      "description": "ï»¿ Community | Working at Quinnipiac University Site Alert Title Search is currently not available. Why Quinnipiac Admissions Undergraduate Graduate Medicine Law Online Apply Now Visit Make a Gift Contact Us Bookstores The Quinnipiac Experience Academics Student Experience Athletics & Recreation Explore Quinnipiac Quinnipiac Today Virtual Tour About Quinnipiac Alumni & Parents Alumni Parents Make a Gift Schools & Programs College of Arts & Sciences School of Business School of Communications School of Education School of Engineering School of Health Sciences School of Law School of Medicine School of Nursing Program Finder Dual-Degree Programs Visit Us Virtual Tour Open Houses Maps & Directions Tours & Info Sessions Information & Resources Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Bookstores Course Finder Diversity & Inclusion Events Calendar Faculty & Staff Directory Health & Campus Safety Student Consumer Information Tuition & Financial Aid University Policies For College Counselors For Community For Employers For Military For News Media Research & Organizations Institutes & Centers Ireland's Great Hunger Museum Quinnipiac University Online Quinnipiac University Poll Quinnipiac Magazine Helpful Links Log in to MyQ Make a Tuition Payment Manage a QCard Request a Transcript Work at Quinnipiac Schools Arts & Sciences Business Communications Education Engineering Health Sciences Law Medicine Nursing Looking for a specific program? Program Listing Dual-Degree Programs Working at Quinnipiac Community Carret icon Community Working at Quinnipiac Explore Job Opportunities Application Process Benefits Community Introduction Working at Quinnipiac means youâll be part of a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twelcoming and supportive community. Youâll be challenged and supported to\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsucceed â both professionally and personally. Quinnipiac Difference Find a second family at Quinnipiac There are countless opportunities in which to get involved at Quinnipiac. As a member of our faculty or staff, you will be a vital member of the university \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcommunity. Lace up your skates and take the ice at our M&T Bank Arena for\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta season of heart-pounding intramural ice hockey. Roll up your sleeves and perform \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcommunity service with your colleagues and students as part of The Big Event. Or \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlearn how to live a healthier lifestyle at one of our monthy health and wellness events. Attend a conversation with a Nobel Laureate, participate in a Pilates class or learn a foreign\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlanguage. Regardless of your choice, you will be supported by a dedicated and professional community. Encouraging Others Our students, faculty, and staff come together to innovate and transform their passions at Bobcat Nation. Diversity and Inclusion We believe in the power of community and belonging Your career is about more than your job. Itâs about meeting new\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpeople with diverse experiences and perspectives. Youâll be part\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tof a community that celebrates unique backgrounds, beliefs and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tidentities. We bring faculty and staff of different backgrounds together to highlight the broad cultural tapestry of Quinnipiac. This event is to foster cultural awareness, global diversity, and to strengthen cross-cultural understanding through presentation, video and conversation. It also affords a way to interact and engage with others in the community that you may not know, and learn something new about your colleague. As an Equal Opportunity Employer, we have a strong commitment to\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe principles and practices of diversity and inclusion, and we\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twelcome candidates who will enhance that diversity. Learn more about diversity and inclusion at Quinnipiac Working\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttogether Students, faculty and staff\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tof various backgrounds come together to develop a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmore dynamic and inclusive community. Photograph Relationships inside\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand outside the classroom Engineering faculty take on\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tstudents in the third annual soccer game on the York\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHill Campus. Here, Assistant Professor of Civil\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEngineering Angel Ari Perez high-fives a student on\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe sidelines. Photograph Community Stories A Quinnipiac Education Compassion defines Dwayne\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBoucaudâs teaching approach Professor Dwayne Boucaud's focus is his students,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand his concern for them extends beyond the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclassroom. World-Sized Classroom Professor transitions from\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRomanian national tennis team to Quinnipiac\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclassroom Antoaneta Vanc never imagined that education would be\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ther vocation. Photograph Mount Carmel Quad The Mount Carmel Campus,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tpictured above, is one of our three campuses located\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tin Hamden and North Haven. Our beautiful environment\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand state-of-the-art facilities will inspire you\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tevery day. Photograph Working Environment Our Campuses 3 campuses purposefully built for your success Across our 3 campuses, you will meet other members of our dedicated and caring\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfaculty and staff. You may interact with students, and have an impact on their\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlearning. You'll get to work in our state-of-the-art buildings, and walk around\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe picturesque grounds, witnessing up close the beauty and charm of southern\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNew England. Each of our campuses has been purposely designed to deliver the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tquintessential student experience. The Mount Carmel Campus is home to many of our academic buildings, a student\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcenter, a recreation and fields, and first- and second-year student residence\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thalls. The York Hill Campus offers idyllic views of the area, a student center,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tresidence halls and the TD Bank Sports Center, home of the ice hockey and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbasketball teams. The North Haven Campus, located just 10 minutes from the\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHamden campuses, is the heart of study for the Schools of Education, Health\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSciences, Law, Medicine and Nursing, with state-of-the-art facilities, equipment\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand environments purposely designed for collaborative learning. Our Campuses Maps and Directions Our Location Best of both worlds Our southern New England location offers the charm and tradition of the region,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twith easy access to the culture and lifestyle of some of Americaâs most\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tinteresting and vibrant cities. Live the New England lifestyle by exploring the many local hiking and biking\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttrails, visiting nearby seaside towns or apple picking at a local orchard. Just\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tacross the street from the Mount Carmel Campus is Sleeping Giant State Park,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tperfect for every ability level. For a change of pace, we are located only 15 minutes from New Haven, where you\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twill find a city bursting with energy and culture. Or jump on a train headed to\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNew York City or Boston, which are both under 2 hours away. Culture and nightlife at\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tyour doorstep New Haven combines the colonial\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttradition of New England with the modern innovations of\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta major city. Nature and inspiration\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twithin footsteps Our 3 campuses are situated\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taround several outdoor walking, hiking and biking\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttrails, as well as state and town parks. Photograph Reaching new\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\theights Tami Reilly, associate\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tathletic director for fitness and wellness, talks\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twith students, faculty and staff participating in a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thike up Sleeping Giant State Park. Participants\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbegin at the foot of the scenic trails with a moment\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tof guided meditation. When they reach the peak after\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe hike, the group practices guided yoga. Photograph Wellness Wellness matters Living Well and Virgin Pulse Wellness Program is a university-wide initiative to provide Quinnipiac \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUniversity faculty and staff with tools, resources, and support to achieve their own wellness goals. The Living Well team is dedicated to educating, motivating, and empowering individuals to make healthy \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlifestyle choices by offering a variety of on-campus wellness events, and maintaining a health and \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twellness website with health tips and resources for everyday use, including links for fitness classes \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t(free for all faculty and staff), healthy recipes and other helpful resources. Our campuses are also \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttobacco-free to promote the health and well-being of our students, faculty, staff, and visitors. Employee wellness is an important part of our culture here.  Employees can earn a variety of \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twellness incentives by participating in activities and challenges throughout the year. The Business Council of Fairfield County has recognized QU for their understanding of the \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcompetitive advantage of promoting a healthy workforce and for offering a diverse range \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tof programs. âEncouraging physical\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tactivity, promoting healthy eating choices and\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmanaging chronic illness are the cornerstones of\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsuccess for this yearâs honorees. Of interest to\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tour panel of reviewers this year was the number\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tof programs that broadened the definition of\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\twellness to include financial and emotional\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thealth.â Anthony Aguanno Senior account executive,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUnitedHealthcare and co-chair, The Business\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCouncilâs Wellness Roundtable Our vision is to: Provide QU faculty and staff with access to wellness resources and programs Integrate a wellness philosophy across departments and campuses Encourage and reward healthy choices Make wellness fun Engage faculty and staff in physical activity Promote preventive health care Empower individuals to take charge of their physical, mental and spiritual\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thealth Take the Next Step Join our community Explore and apply Learn more About Quinnipiac About Quinnipiac https://www.facebook.com/QuinnipiacUniversity http://twitter.com/quinnipiacu https://instagram.com/quinnipiacu © 2024 Quinnipiac University. All Rights Reserved. Website Security and Privacy Policy Legal Info"
    },
